## Permissions

The provider's account needs `Get-`, `Import-` and `Remove-ExchangeCertificate`, from the **Exchange Server Certificates** management role, and `Get-TransportService` (default SMTP certificate), from the **Send Connectors** role. The role group created by [`tools/new_role_group.ps1`](https://github.com/workplace-as-code/terraform-provider-msexchangeserver/blob/main/tools/new_role_group.ps1) grants them through a custom role without `Export-ExchangeCertificate`, which exports private keys. See the [Authentication guide](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/workplace-as-code/msexchangeserver/latest/docs/guides/authentication).

